The field is now `parents`, still protobuf field 2. The old name was never released, so nothing is reserved.

```ts
await sandbox.filesystem.makeDirectory("/tmp/kit-files/nested", {
  parents: false,
});
```

```go
err := instance.Filesystem().MakeDirectory(ctx, "/tmp/kit-files/nested", &sandbox.MakeDirectoryOptions{
	Parents: sandbox.Value(false),
})
```

Leave `parents` unset and each provider keeps its own default. `false` still means the parent directory must already exist. Daytona rejects that value before the call, and the error field is `parents`. Modal receives it as `createParents`.

